+## Frontend axes
+
+Zero ComfyUI frontend extensions, zero JS-only graph definitions and zero backend routes in the exact pinned source. No frontend conversion, ambient DOM, browser storage or shortcut interception added.
+
+## Authority and implementation
+
+Reviewed text/scalar/routing algorithms remain pack-side with public static io.ComfyNode schemas. These 45 draft nodes declare SDK_REFS=True and zero permissions. No legacy bridge, runtime source evaluation, raw access, host imports, filesystem/network/subprocess or runtime installs occur in their migrated entrypoint. Immutable pristine class AST bodies are used only by tests as bounded oracles.
+
+Input/output text is bounded to 256 KiB; integer magnitude is bounded to 4,096 bits. Replacement expansion is checked before allocation; blacklist line-count/workload is bounded. CR-BLACKLIST-EXPANDED-WORK-01 corrects the original-length-only estimate: the successor subtracts actual current text length before each nonblank replacement under the unchanged16,777,216 cumulative-character limit. The601 projected case actually visits19,628,033 replacement-input characters in pristine; the successor refuses before the513th replacement, after512 calls/16,744,449 characters. This is a supported workload narrowing, not a claimed pristine exception.375 focused source/pure checks pass twice, including two fresh zero-capability guests and the real outer executor with admitted growth, refusal and post-refusal recovery; historical9935 aggregate runs attest the frozen predecessor, not this successor. These are explicit direct-input safety narrowings, not unbounded malformed-input parity. Native ordinary input semantics and original defaults/names/categories/display labels are preserved.
+
+Concrete pending boundaries include typed ModelRef/ClipRef merging, exact RandomLoRA fingerprint state with bounded atomic per-user/pack persistence, managed imports/catalogues/output artifacts, mutable styles/schedules, guest graphics initialization, actual font pixel/resource evidence, and model load/inference. Public APIs are preferred; missing safe useful intent is not security rejection.
+
+## Upstream defects and parity limits
+
